00:01:01.335 --> 00:01:04.220
I was 25, had my first church.

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:06.600
If you would have asked me
what my ambition was,

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.917
I would have told you
I wanted to be a megachurch pastor.

00:01:10.918 --> 00:01:14.865
I wanted a 15-, 20,000-member church.

00:01:14.865 --> 00:01:17.675
I wanted my own television ministry.

00:01:17.675 --> 00:01:20.391
I wanted my own clothing line.

00:01:20.391 --> 00:01:21.747
(Laughter)

00:01:21.747 --> 00:01:23.888
I wanted to be your long distance carrier.

00:01:23.888 --> 00:01:25.732
You know, the whole nine yards.

00:01:25.732 --> 00:01:28.425
(Laughter)

